      "text": "if Saints obtain land by blood, they will be scourged from city to city, D&C 63:31. those who die in the Lord will receive inheritance in holy city, D&C 63:49. proclaim gospel from city to city, D&C 66:5. wo to city that rejects elders, D&C 84:94 (109:41). peace and salvation to come to city that accepts elders, D&C 109:39–40. Saints to gather and build up cities, D&C 125:2. recorder to be appointed in each ward of city, D&C 128:3.",
